# This repository is a deliberately small, media-only project showcase.
# Default-deny prevents local papers, source trees, archives, logs and notes
# from being added accidentally.
*

!.gitignore
!.nojekyll
!README.md
!NOTICE.md
!index.html
!404.html
!site.webmanifest
!robots.txt
!sitemap.xml
!assets/
!assets/**
